    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Employee Onboarding\n\nThis workflow will Query Odoo Employees against LDAP to see if there are any new employees entered.  The Compare Datasets will show all records in Odoo that are not in LDAP, Path B in the compare dataset will contain the new employee list.\n\n1) Add this employee to LDAP\n2) Create (or reactivate) an email account\n3) Create (or reactivate) a VOIP account\n4) Optional - Create (or reactivate) a Webex Account\n5) Send Onboarding Welcome Email\n6) Automated call by AI to new employee to ask questions.\n ",
        "height": 327,
        "width": 515
      },
      "id": "05534894-d06b-4715-b44c-4e8a3f7cd2ba",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2016,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "80f4ae96-41a6-484c-8262-ef97a40be57b",
              "name": "id",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "508c4f01-ce85-4924-b91a-c8a9ad6aeca0",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $json.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "8b467c90-a45d-4264-9d00-8fcfa1e5985c",
              "name": "job_title",
              "value": "={{ $json.job_title }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f17459d4-312a-492a-96b4-a3aeece918e0",
              "name": "department",
              "value": "={{ $json.department_id[1] }}",
